\begin{description}
\item[* language:] Spanish
\item[* name:] TREFLspelling1a
\item[* kind of rule:] M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] Verbppropformation
\item[* class:] TC:REFLspelling
\item[* date of creation:] 10-JULY-1987 14:15:00  
